{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密和尚法衣塔、費和尚舍利冏塔、車和尚全身塔同在一室。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附自荅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其人卒死"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "浙江藩臺李公士楨、嘉興太守盧公崇興捐梓。\n水鑑海和十卷，送楞嚴寺經坊，隨\n大藏流行。伏願人人開法眼，箇箇悟心宗。\n康熙丙辰冬月吉旦，旌德周漢臣書，劉御臣刻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "士楨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雍建"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在恪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "繼文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "神秀禪師住度門，為兩京法主、三帝國師。跏趺觀君，肩輿上殿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次古韻古題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有鐵臥坡下，傳為寺毀鐘鎔，人屢竊，卒雷雨驚退。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "郎函山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序，長干即今報恩寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四山：黃檗、福嚴、金粟、興陽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明知明識請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金粟繭紙箋藏，今僅存四十餘輔，或云宋賜，或云五聖書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坡為五祖戒禪師後身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西蜀本懷上請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天王常住請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楚菴璨監院請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲澤旵侍者請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善菴真請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "半峰青請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲樹果請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信菴哲請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "祖殿還燈敏請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "幻寓山房憨夢亭請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古松正請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鶴林芝菴，明請鶴林主，山名雙峰"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地藏常住請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃龍常住請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "棲賢常住請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金粟常住請師住，當第十代"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛照寬請時，見玉泉舉古華山之詩，乃題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "約四五千斤，或云寺毀鐘鎔，或云象鎔。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此鐵康熙丙寅巡憲祖公載入荊志"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名碧雲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱象璜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱斌，來書請詳悉天王之訛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱光旭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱燿祖，時在金陵醫王。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱培繼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱三禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "康熙元年撰文，二十三年立石。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "康熙二年撰文立石，二十三年入志。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "浙江藩臺李公士楨、嘉興太守盧公崇興捐梓。\n水鑑海和尚六會錄十卷，送楞嚴寺經坊，隨\n大藏流行。伏願傳燈無盡，祖道昌隆。\n康熙丙辰冬月吉旦，旌德湯搢之書，李子受刻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X82n1571_p0511a24"}
